    rdf:value """Friday, Apr. 19, 1907
Called on Father Brown. Mrs. Head called, dear old lady.
Bernhard called on Placci and they motored back with the Serristori and Rembelinski and stayed till 7. Hapgoods dined with him."""^^xsd:string ;
